<title>USA: Miller says launching beer brands in Russia.</title>
<headline>Miller says launching beer brands in Russia.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Miller Brewing Co, a unit of Philip Morris Cos Inc, said it extended distribution of its brands into Russia, including a new beer made for that market.</p>
<p>Under a three-year agreement starting this month, Miller Brewing International will supply products for distribution through  Stanley Beverages Ltd, a Russian company that distributes to 50 locations throughout Russia.</p>
<p>Selected for export are Miller Genuine Draft in 12-ounce bottles and a new product designed specifically for the Russian market, Miller Magnum 7.2 in 12-ounce bottles and 16-ounce cans, Miller said.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
